  "notes": "USAGE:\n- Written and technical. Everyday speech uses ⟦{浮|う}く→浮く：00413_uku⟧ or ⟦{漂|ただよ}う→漂う：04356_tadayou⟧.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {浮遊感|ふゆうかん}: a floating sensation\n- {浮遊物|ふゆうぶつ}: floating matter\n- {浮遊粒子状物質|ふゆうりゅうしじょうぶっしつ}: suspended particulate matter (air pollution)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{漂|ただよ}う→漂う：04356_tadayou⟧: to drift (everyday; also of smells and moods)",
